json", "paragraphs": ["10月9日、両選手の試合のチケットが1時間で完売したと発表されました。試合は12月11日にカーディフのプリンシパリティ・スタジアムで始まりますが、実際の試合は12月12日の未明になると予想されています。チケットの価格は手数料込みで最高1万3128ポンド、最低88.50ポンドでした。", "チケットは金曜日の正午に約8万枚が発売されました。販売開始から数分で、50万人以上がオンラインの待機列に並びました。"], "paragraphs_zh": ["10月9日宣布，两位选手比赛的门票一小时就卖光了。比赛将于12月11日在加的夫的公国球场开始，但实际比赛预计在12月12日凌晨进行。门票含手续费最高1万3128英镑，最低88.50英镑。", "门票于周五中午发售约8万张。开卖几分钟后，就有超过50万人在网上排队。很快转售网站上就出现了门票，拳台边VIP座位卖到7万3645英镑，上层看台座位卖425英镑。"], "body": "10月9日、両選手の試合のチケットが1時間で完売したと発表されました。試合は12月11日にカーディフのプリンシパリティ・スタジアムで始まりますが、実際の試合は12月12日の未明になると予想されています。チケットの価格は手数料込みで最高1万3128ポンド、最低88.50ポンドでした。\n\nチケットは金曜日の正午に約8万枚が発売されました。販売開始から数分で、50万人以上がオンラインの待機列に並びました。", "body_zh": "10月9日宣布，两位选手比赛的门票一小时就卖光了。比赛将于12月11日在加的夫的公国球场开始，但实际比赛预计在12月12日凌晨进行。门票含手续费最高1万3128英镑，最低88.50英镑。\n\n门票于周五中午发售约8万张。开卖几分钟后，就有超过50万人在网上排队。很快转售网站上就出现了门票，拳台边VIP座位卖到7万3645英镑，上层看台座位卖425英镑。", "text": "10月9日、両選手の試合のチケットが1時間で完売したと発表されました。試合は12月11日にカーディフのプリンシパリティ・スタジアムで始まりますが、実際の試合は12月12日の未明になると予想されています。チケットの価格は手数料込みで最高1万3128ポンド、最低88.50ポンドでした。 チケットは金曜日の正午に約8万枚が発売されました。販売開始から数分で、50万人以上がオンラインの待機列に並びました。", "vocab": [{"word": "完売", "pos": "noun", "zh": "卖光，售罄", "note": "常用来表示门票、商品等全部卖完"}, {"word": "予想", "pos": "noun", "zh": "预测，预计", "note": "常与「〜と予想される」搭配"}, {"word": "手数料", "pos": "noun", "zh": "手续费", "note": "购票时额外收取的费用"}, {"word": "発売", "pos": "noun", "zh": "发售，开始卖", "note": "常用于门票、商品等开始销售"}, {"word": "待機列", "pos": "noun", "zh": "等候队列", "note": "网上排队等待的队列"}, {"word": "転売", "pos": "noun", "zh": "转卖，倒卖", "note": "常指以高价转卖门票等"}, {"word": "放送", "pos": "noun", "zh": "播放，播出", "note": "电视或网络播放节目"}, {"word": "興行主", "pos": "noun", "zh": "演出主办人， promoter", "note": "组织拳击等活动的推广人"}, {"word": "契約", "pos": "noun", "zh": "合同，契约", "note": "常与「結ぶ」搭配，表示签订合同"}, {"word": "候補", "pos": "noun", "zh": "候选，候补", "note": "表示有可能被选中的对象"}, {"word": "記者会見", "pos": "noun", "zh": "记者会，新闻发布会", "note": "公开接受媒体采访的场合"}, {"word": "賞金", "pos": "noun", "zh": "奖金", "note": "比赛中获胜者得到的钱"}], "title_original": "Fury-Joshua tickets priced up to £13,000 sell out in one hour", "summary_original": "Tickets for Tyson Fury and Anthony Joshua's fight at Cardiff's Principality Stadium sells out in just one hour.", "body_original": "Fury-Joshua tickets priced up to £13,000 sell out in one hour\nPublished\n9 October 2026\nTickets for Tyson Fury and Anthony Joshua's fight at Cardiff's Principality Stadium have sold out in just one hour.\nFury and Joshua will meet on a bill that begins on 11 December but they are not expected to fight until the early hours of 12 December.\nThe highest-priced tickets were available at £13,128, including booking fees, with the lowest at £88.50.\nThe all-British heavyweight contest, which will be broadcast globally on Netflix, was\nannounced in September\nand around 80,000 tickets went on sale at 12:00 BST on Friday.\nJust minutes after the tickets went on sale more than 500,000 people were waiting in the online queue.\nTickets quickly began emerging on resale websites, with ringside VIP seats being advertised for £73,645, while upper tier seats were available for £425.\nRingwalks are\nexpected to start around 01:00 GMT\non Saturday 12 December, following a short live music performance, and the stadium will remain open until 03:30.\nThe event is being promoted as a collaboration between Saudi boxing powerbroker Turki Alalshikh's The Ring and UFC chief Dana White.\nOrganisers are yet to confirm any of the undercard fights.\nWhat information do we collect from this quiz?\nJoshua, 36, and Fury, 38 - both former two-time world champions - signed contracts for the bout earlier this year, but the date and venue had yet to be confirmed.\nLondon's Wembley Stadium and New York's Madison Square Garden were the frontrunners to stage the fight, but both presented issues before Cardiff emerged as an alternative.\nThe Principality Stadium has hosted late-night boxing before, including Joe Calzaghe's fight with Mikkel Kessler in November 2007, which began at 01:00 GMT.\nRicky Hatton's victory over Kostya Tszyu at Manchester's MEN Arena in 2005 began at about 02:00 local time, allowing US broadcaster Showtime to show the fight on Saturday evening.\nJust 11 days ago, there was uncertainty over whether the fight would even take place due to a dispute over the role of UFC chief White in the promotion of the event.\nBroadcaster Netflix said Alalshikh's The Ring and White would collaborate to promote the event, but Joshua's promoter Eddie Hearn said his fighter's contract prevented White from having a promotional role.\nThe British rivals finally met at a news conference on 30 September to begin the build-up to one of the most anticipated fights in British history.\nFury and Joshua are reported to be sharing a purse worth close to $200m (£151m)\nRelated topics\nBoxing\nBoxing schedule and results 2026\nPublished\n1 day ago\nWatch every Born to Brawl episode\nPublished\n28 April 2024\nMore boxing from the BBC\nNotifications, social media and more with BBC Sport\nPublished\n28 August", "fetched_at": "2026-10-10T01:08:30.325164", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "10", "s": 0.125, "e": 0.483, "sm": 125, "em": 483, "cs": 0, "ce": 2, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "月", "s": 0.483, "e": 0.662, "sm": 483, "em": 662, "cs": 2, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "9", "s": 0.675, "e": 0.969, "sm": 675, "em": 968, "cs": 3, "ce": 4, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "日", "s": 0.969, "e": 1.263, "sm": 968, "em": 1262, "cs": 4, "ce": 5, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "、", "s": 1.263, "e": 1.65, "sm": 1262, "em": 1650, "cs": 5, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "両", "s": 1.65, "e": 1.887, "sm": 1650, "em": 1887, "cs": 6, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "選手", "s": 1.9, "e": 2.275, "sm": 1900, "em": 2275, "cs": 7, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "の", "s": 2.288, "e": 2.388, "sm": 2287, "em": 2387, "cs": 9, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "試合", "s": 2.4, "e": 2.775, "sm": 2400, "em": 2775, "cs": 10, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "の", "s": 2.788, "e": 2.863, "sm": 2787, "em": 2862, "cs": 12, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "チケット", "s": 2.875, "e": 